# Aliyun ARTC SDK for Windows drops in:
#   deploy/edge/windows/vendor/aliyun-artc-windows/
#     *.dll
#     *.pyd
#     ...
#
# This directory is gitignored in production — the SDK is licensed and
# distributed via an internal artifact bucket per spec § "外部资源".
# The PyInstaller spec globs *.dll / *.pyd from the vendor dir at build
# time; absence yields a smoke-test binary that fails at RTC join.
